      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.40 (up from ₹0.096 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹15.5m (up 268% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹4.82m (up ₹4.49m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 31% (up from 7.8% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 193% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
